# Environment Variables Configuration

Create a `.env` file in the project root with the following variables:

## Development with XAMPP Backend

```env
# API Configuration
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost/project-eric-api/api

# Optional: Enable debug mode
VITE_DEBUG=true
```

## Without Backend (Default — Uses Mock Data)

```env
# Leave empty to use built-in mock data
VITE_API_URL=
```

## Production

```env
# Your production API URL
VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api
```

---

## Quick Setup

1. Copy this file and rename it to `.env`
2. Update the values as needed
3. Restart your Vite dev server

For XAMPP setup instructions, see `/xampp-backend/project-eric-api/README.md`.
